<title>USA: State of Georgia, $16.435 mln won by J.P. Morgan.</title>
<headline>State of Georgia, $16.435 mln won by J.P. Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it won $16.435 million of State of Georgia, general obligation bonds, 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 4.22 percent.</p>
</text>
